claim.claim-text:
a display (540);
a communication circuit (530);
a control circuit (510); and
a memory (520) electrically connected to the control circuit (510),
wherein the memory (520) stores instructions enabling the control circuit (510) to:

display, on the display (540) of the electronic device (500), a content with an icon for controlling the display of the content;
based on an execution of a sharing function between the electronic device (500) and an external device (1000), transmit, to the external device (1000) in a streaming mode, data associated with the content for simultaneously displaying on a display of the external device (1000), without transmitting data associated with the icon; and
based on a user input via the icon, cease transmission of the data associated with the content and periodically transmit a status image indicating a pause state of the sharing function to the external device, while continuing to display, on the display (540) of the electronic device (500), the content and the icon.
